; REFACTOR STAGING TREE (library vfft_v2r) — the module-structure rework
; of lib/ (vfft_v2). Byte-identity of generated codelets against the
; production tree is enforced by the stage gate battery. Production
; lib/ stays authoritative until this tree is promoted.
;
; Pipeline order (top of pipe to bottom):
;   Expr      — symbolic math IR
;   Ir        — hash-consed DAG IR + smart constructors (CSE)
;   Algsimp   — algebraic rewrite passes over Ir
;   Uarch     — microarchitecture tables (RPL, SPR, ZEN5, ...)
;   Schedule  — list scheduler (uses Uarch table)
;   Regalloc  — linear-scan register allocator
;   Emit_c    — emit C with AVX-512/AVX2 intrinsics
;
; Math-layer modules (one per transform type):
;   Dft       — complex-to-complex DFT
;   Dft_r2c   — real-to-complex / complex-to-real DFT (Hermitian-symmetric)
(library
 (name vfft_v2r)
 (libraries unix)
 (modules expr ir algsimp cnum split_radix dft dft_r2c simd_ir uarch isa schedule annotate regalloc emit_c pipeline codelet_oop bb coverage gen_main))
